container.innerHTML=`<section class="blacksite bs-shelter" aria-label="Blacksite permanent 3D shelter survival"><header class="bs-head"><div><small>PERMANENT MAIN GAME / ENDLESS SHELTER SURVIVAL</small><h2>BLACKSITE<span>SHELTER SHIFT</span></h2></div><div class="bs-header-actions"><button class="bs-sound" aria-label="Toggle game sound">Sound: off</button><button class="bs-pause" disabled>Pause</button><button class="bs-exit-mode" hidden>Exit game mode ✕</button></div></header><div class="bs-stage"><canvas class="bs-canvas" tabindex="0" aria-label="WASD move. Mouse aim and click shoot. E interact, Space dash, R parry, Q vent, V infusion, F cycle weapon."></canvas><div class="bs-vignette"></div><div class="bs-hud" hidden><div class="bs-mission"><span class="bs-floor"></span><strong class="bs-objective"></strong><small class="bs-notice"></small><div class="bs-boss-panel" hidden><span>BOSS <small class="bs-boss-phase"></small></span><strong class="bs-boss-name"></strong><meter class="bs-warden" min="0" max="100" value="100" aria-label="Boss integrity"></meter><small class="bs-boss-health"></small></div><div class="bs-base-label">SHELTER <b></b><meter class="bs-base" min="0" max="1100" value="1100"></meter></div></div><canvas class="bs-map" width="120" height="120" aria-label="District radar: shelter, buildings, player and horde"></canvas><div class="bs-vitals"><label>INTEGRITY <b class="bs-hp-num">100</b><meter class="bs-hp" min="0" max="100" value="100"></meter></label><label>STAMINA<meter class="bs-stamina" min="0" max="100" value="100"></meter></label><label>WEAPON HEAT<meter class="bs-heat" min="0" max="100" value="0"></meter></label></div><div class="bs-haul"></div><div class="bs-kit"></div><div class="bs-interact" hidden></div><div class="bs-channel" hidden><span>EXTRACTING · STAY STILL / WEAPON DOWN</span><progress max="5" value="0"></progress></div><div class="bs-touch"><div class="bs-joystick bs-move" role="group" aria-label="Movement joystick"><i></i><span>MOVE</span></div><div class="bs-touch-actions"><button class="bs-dash">DASH</button><button class="bs-parry">PARRY</button><button class="bs-vent">VENT</button><button class="bs-use">USE / E</button><button class="bs-vial">VIAL</button><button class="bs-cycle">WEAPON</button></div><div class="bs-joystick bs-aim" role="group" aria-label="Aim and shoot joystick"><i></i><span>AIM / FIRE</span></div></div></div><div class="bs-overlay"><small>LOADING DISTRICT</small><h3>Your lease<br>is under siege.</h3></div><section class="bs-shop" hidden aria-label="Bongo's scrap shop"><div class="bs-shop-head"><div><span>BONGO’S BAD FINANCIAL DECISIONS</span><h3>Scrap shop.</h3><small class="bs-shop-wallet"></small></div><button class="bs-shop-close">Back to defending ✕</button></div><p>Run scrap only. No money or purchases. The horde keeps moving while you shop. Attachments apply to the equipped weapon and reset next raid.</p><div class="bs-weapon-rack" aria-label="Owned weapons"></div><div class="bs-shop-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Shop categories"></div><div class="bs-shop-items" role="tabpanel"></div></section></div><div class="bs-toolbar"><button class="bs-mode button secondary">⛶ Fullscreen / game mode</button><button class="bs-bank button" disabled>Extract · unlocks at 1:00</button></div><div class="bs-status" role="status">Loading the locally hosted 3D engine.</div><details class="bs-manual"><summary>Controls, shelter rules & weapon synergies</summary><div><p><b>Desktop:</b> WASD or arrows move. Mouse aims; hold click to fire. <b>E interacts</b> when a prompt appears. Space dashes. <b>R parries</b> nearby shots back at attackers. Q vents heat; V uses an infusion vial. F cycles owned weapons; 1–5 equip directly. X begins or cancels extraction. Escape pauses.</p><p><b>Phone:</b> left stick moves, right stick aims/fires. Use the six action buttons between them. The USE button performs the same contextual action as E. Fullscreen/game mode fits portrait or landscape.</p><p><b>Your shelter:</b> protect the reactor. Losing it ends the raid even if you are alive. Bongo’s shop is inside the shelter; press E nearby. Build up to four automatic turrets, add Tesla/cryo effects, repair the reactor, or buy weapons and feature attachments. Scavenge lockers inside the other buildings for scrap. Leaving the base has a cost. The rats do not pay rent.</p><p><b>Build a broken weapon:</b> chain lightning, plasma pools, quad shots, ricochets, piercing rivets, freezing/shatter combos, healing on kills, and orbital rats. Combine them on the weapon of your choice. Weapons and upgrades use earned run scrap; they reset each raid. Free profile cosmetics never buy power.</p><p><b>The bosses:</b> Mortgage Mole burrows and erupts under you. The Unlicensed Archer is a beige mannequin with a bow and telegraphed arrow rain. Sludgemass is extremely tanky and slow, with low damage and persistent sludge. Mr. Potency starts weak, returns nine seconds after defeat, and has a heavily armoured vapour cannon phase; reload windows and projectile parries matter. They are original KME characters and models.</p><p><b>Endless pressure:</b> the main game has no fifteen-minute cutoff or final victory screen. Waves grow, and threat accelerates sharply after eight minutes. Find an absurd synergy, defend your base and choose when to leave. Infusion vials are fictional twenty-second combat buffs. They do not represent nicotine or health effects.</p><p><b>Extraction:</b> unlocks at one minute, takes five stationary uninterrupted seconds and can be interrupted by damage. Death, shelter destruction or abandoning the run banks only 20% of eligible score/capsules and loses the greed reward bonus. Successful extraction banks the full eligible haul. The normal daily shared-boss caps remain. Finale sessions remain five-minute contributions. No run save is promised while the page is closed; confirmed receipts can be retried on the same device.</p></div></details><div class="bs-loot"></div></section>`;
const $=sel=>container.querySelector(sel),box=$('.blacksite'),canvas=$('.bs-canvas'),overlay=$('.bs-overlay'),status=$('.bs-status');const text=t=>status.textContent=t;function show(html){overlay.hidden=false;overlay.innerHTML=html;}function tone(freq=200,d=.05){if(!soundOn)return;try{audio??=new(window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext)();const osc=audio.createOscillator(),gain=audio.createGain();osc.type='triangle';osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(freq,audio.currentTime);osc.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(freq/2,audio.currentTime+d);gain.gain.setValueAtTime(.04,audio.currentTime);gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.001,audio.currentTime+d);osc.connect(gain).connect(audio.destination);osc.start();osc.stop(audio.currentTime+d);}catch{}}
function intro(){show('<span class="bs-tag">PERMANENT MAIN GAME / ENDLESS SURVIVAL</span><h3>Defend the lease.<br>Break the build.</h3><p>A whole district to loot. A shelter to lose. A goblin shopkeeper with absolutely no refund policy.</p><div class="bs-brief"><span>01 <b>SCAVENGE</b> buildings for scrap</span><span>02 <b>BUILD</b> weapons & turrets</span><span>03 <b>EXTRACT</b> before the horde wins</span></div><button class="button bs-start">Start a shelter shift ↗</button><p class="bs-tip">E interact · R parry · V infusion<br>Endless pressure. Run upgrades reset. The rats remain.</p>');text(o.mode==='finale'?'Shared boss finale: five-minute checkpoint contribution.':'BLACKSITE stays here permanently. Rotating Arcade is a separate cabinet.');if(receipt)retryScreen();}
